      "content": "<div class=\"mm-release-marker\" data-mm-release=\"f94027611ab71565c9dfd689046bb4a24db921b97ef1453416d5acfa140ed605\" data-mm-topic=\"t-mm-13-001\" hidden></div>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[24308]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: ##FFFFFF; font-family: \"Calibri Light\", sans-serif; font-size: 16pt'><strong>1. </strong></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: ##FFFFFF; font-family: \"Calibri Light\", sans-serif; font-size: 16pt'><strong>WHAT IS CLINICAL GOVERNANCE?</strong></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: ##FFFFFF; font-family: \"Calibri Light\", sans-serif; font-size: 16pt'><strong> </strong></span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[24309]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Clinical Governance is defined as a framework through which NHS organizations are accountable for continuously improving the quality of the services and safeguarding standards of the care by creating an environment in which excellence in the clinical care will flourish.</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[24310]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: ##222222; font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: ##222222; font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Traditionally, clinical governance has been described using 7 key pillars:\u00a0</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[24311]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Times New Roman\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>clinical effectiveness and research\u00a0</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[24312]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: ##222222; font-family: \"Times New Roman\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>clinical audit\u00a0</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[24313]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: ##222222; font-family: \"Times New Roman\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>risk management\u00a0</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[24314]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: ##222222; font-family: \"Times New Roman\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>education and training\u00a0</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[24315]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: ##222222; font-family: \"Times New Roman\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>patient and public involvement (PPI)</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[24316]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: ##222222; font-family: \"Times New Roman\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>information management\u00a0</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[24317]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: ##222222; font-family: \"Times New Roman\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>staff management.\u00a0</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[24318]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: ##222222; font-family: \"Times New Roman\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>The various elements of clinical governance, when brought together,\u00a0acquire the ability to improve the efficiency of systems</span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[24319]\">\u00a0</p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[24320]\">\u00a0</p>",
